alse,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17127,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T12:16:49-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"12:16:49","sender":"DV","content":"Essa ta linda demais","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17128,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T12:25:22-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"12:25:22","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"Você nunca tá sozinho amor","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17129,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T12:25:28-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"12:25:28","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"So to sempre com você","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17130,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T13:49:42-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"13:49:42","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"Escrevi a resposta daquela carta que eu gostaria de mandar como resposta. Acho que seja melhor deixar quieto mas escrevo mesmo assim","type":"text","is_edited":true,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17131,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T13:49:58-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"13:49:58","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"Dear Mrs Kean, I am writing in response to the letter I received from your office dated August 8th 2024 regarding false accusations about your client to friends and on social platforms. First, I want to clarify that the post in question was not directed at your client, nor did it reference him in any way. The content I shared was a general statement by a psychologist about toxic relationships, something that, unfortunately, many people experience. I have every right to express my thoughts on such matters, particularly when they do not implicate or reference any individual directly. I also want to state clearly that I have never made any false accusations about your client to my friends or family. On the contrary, I have gone to great lengths to maintain my privacy and dignity during this difficult time. However, I have evidence that your client has been engaging in behavior intended to harm my reputation. This includes sending emails and messages to mutual friends, sharing our private legal correspondence, and disclosing details of our divorce agreement. Furthermore, he has sent texts to various individuals making derogatory statements about me, which I find deeply troubling. Your letter feels like yet another attempt by your client to exert control and gaslight me, and I want to make it unequivocally clear that I will not be subjected to this behavior any longer. As a woman who has lived through an unhealthy and toxic relationship, I am committed to advocating for myself and others who may have endured similar experiences. Please inform your client that any further attempts to intimidate or harass me will not be tolerated. I would prefer to handle this matter amicably, but I am prepared to take the necessary legal steps to protect myself and my rights if this behavior persists. Thank you for your attention to this matter. Sincerely, Martha","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17132,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T14:32:43-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"14:32:43","sender":"DV","content":"Gostei","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17133,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T14:32:50-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"14:32:50","sender":"DV","content":"Ursinho rebelou","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17134,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T14:34:30-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"14:34:30","sender":"Martha Graeff","content":"Sim","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17135,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T14:46:11-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"14:46:11","sender":"DV","content":"Eu incluiria no segundo paragrafo uma referencia a liberdade de expressão amplamente defendida no país. Mas acho que esta bom.","type":"text","is_edited":false,"attachment":null,"urls":[]},{"id":17136,"timestamp":"2024-08-14T14:46:15-03:00","date":"2024-08-14","time":"14:46:15"